# bin/genmedia-launch is SOURCE (a POSIX shell launcher), not a build artifact,
# and must ship with this module so the series runs from a fresh checkout. The
# repo-root .gitignore excludes any `bin/` directory; re-include this one and its
# launcher script. (Downloaded genmedia binaries live in $GENMEDIA_CACHE, not
# here, so nothing built ever lands in this dir.)
!bin/
!bin/genmedia-launch
